[95.549966, "o", "\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[95.594546, "o", "What the PEP asks the policy engine about issue_refund on ticket T-501, and where each part comes from\r\n\r\n  principal  bob (role support)\r\n             WHO is asking: the signed-in user, from the session; the model can't change it\r\n  action     issue_refund\r\n             WHAT they want to do: the tool's name\r\n  resource   TSG::Order O-1001: customer sam@customer.example, total 4500 cents\r\n             ON WHAT: the order the argument names, looked up in data/orders.json\r\n  context    input   {\"order_id\": \"O-1001\", \"amount_cents\": 4500, \"currency\": \"USD\", \"reason\": \"ticket T-501\"}\r\n                     the arguments: the ONLY part that came from the model\r\n             ticket  {\"id\": \"T-501\", \"requester\": \"sam@customer.example\"}   from the ticket the user opened\r\n             window  {\"refunds_1h\": 0, \"denials_10m\": 0}   counted from past receipts\r\n             approval {\"verified\": false}   a signed approval, if there is one\r\n"]
[95.601622, "o", "\u001b[?2004h\u001b]0;thesecguy@lab: ~/ai-security-course-labs/labs/m21\u0007\u001b[01;32mthesecguy@lab\u001b[00m:\u001b[01;34m~/ai-security-course-labs/labs/m21\u001b[00m$ "]
