[142.142068, "o", "\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[142.1844, "o", "Ticket T-502: bob (support) proposes issue_refund {\"order_id\": \"O-1002\", \"amount_cents\": 25000, \"currency\": \"USD\", \"reason\": \"ticket T-502\"}\r\nThe order's customer: sam@customer.example   the ticket's requester: sam@customer.example\r\n\r\nEach hardened policy on its own (setups/hardened/policies), asked of the real Cedar engine:\r\n"]
[142.190476, "o", "  permit  refund_ticket_order              MATCHES  support or supervisor, and the order is the ticket customer's\r\n"]
[142.191418, "o", "  forbid  max_3_refunds_per_hour           no       at most 3 refunds an hour per signed-in user\r\n"]
[142.19237, "o", "  forbid  refund_amount_sane               no       more than 0, in USD, not more than the order cost\r\n"]
[142.193328, "o", "  forbid  refund_over_100_needs_approval   MATCHES  over $100 needs another supervisor's approval  @on_deny(\"defer\")\r\n  (2 more policies are about other tools)\r\n"]
[142.19438, "o", "\r\nAll together: DENY   determined by: refund_over_100_needs_approval\r\nWhy: a forbid that matches wins over any permit.\r\nIt is marked @on_deny(\"defer\"): the PEP holds the call for a supervisor instead of refusing it.\r\n"]
[142.202019, "o", "\u001b[?2004h\u001b]0;thesecguy@lab: ~/ai-security-course-labs/labs/m21\u0007\u001b[01;32mthesecguy@lab\u001b[00m:\u001b[01;34m~/ai-security-course-labs/labs/m21\u001b[00m$ "]
