[164.349979, "o", "\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[164.381002, "o", "Receipt #8 of 21 (data/hunt-receipts.jsonl, a sample morning), field by field\r\n\r\n  time       2027-02-13T09:18:30Z                                         when the PEP decided\r\n  principal  bob                                                          who asked (from the session)\r\n  ticket     T-601                                                        which ticket they had open\r\n  tool       issue_refund                                                 which tool\r\n  raw_args   {\"order_id\": \"O-2001\", \"amount_cents\": 9000, \"currency\": \"   the exact arguments\r\n  decision   DENY                                                         ALLOW, DENY or DEFER\r\n  policies   []                                                           the rules that decided (empty = default deny)\r\n  reason     no policy permits this (denied by default)                   in words\r\n  ran        false                                                        did the tool run?\r\n  prev       9f6cbc5734187371...                                          the hash of the receipt before this one\r\n  hash       67b84347897faf03...                                          SHA-256 of this receipt's content\r\n  sig        1cb49c46c8191e36...                                          the signature over that content\r\n"]
[164.381152, "o", "\r\nRecomputed hash matches: yes   links to receipt #7: yes\r\nChange one character and the hash no longer matches. `make audit` checks every signature too.\r\n"]
